  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2207.02 Identification Cards",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-10-14",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2207.02 Identification Cards.\n\n(a) All identification cards shall be approximately 2\" x 3\" in size.\n\n(b) The identification card shall display a computer generated image of the licensee and his or her signature.\n\n(c) The following shall be displayed on the identification card:\n\n(1) The license number and date of expiration;\n\n(2) The type of license issued;\n\n(3) The name of the employer if the licensee is an employee;\n\n(4) The licensee's:\n\na. Date of birth;\n\nb. Height;\n\nc. Sex;\n\nd. Weight;\n\ne. Color of hair; and\n\nf. Color of eyes; and\n\n(5) The signature of the director of state police.\n\n(d) If the licensee is an individual, the identification card shall so indicate in the space provided for the name of the employer.\n\nSource. #6491, eff 4-22-97; ss by #8308, INTERIM, eff 4-17-05, EXPIRED: 10-14-05\n\nNew. #9484 eff 6-19-09; ss by #12513, eff 4-12-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2200.html"
